cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Scientific Claim Registry (SCR), please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Scientific Claim Registry (SCR) — a versioned memory of how scientific answers evolve"
abstract: >-
  SCR registers scientific questions, the claims (structured, versioned evidence) that answer
  them, and how those answers change over time. It registers; it does not arbitrate. Lipedema is
  the pilot domain; the system is disease-agnostic by design. The rigid, interoperable core is
  specified in the SCR Protocol v1 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20517114).
type: dataset
